  "content": [
    {
      "text": "A large island of the eastern Mediterranean, originally known as Chittim (see Chittim); the birthplace of Barnabas (Acts 4:36); one of the places to which Christian converts went during the persecution that followed the death of Stephen (Acts 11:19–20); visited by Paul and Barnabas (Acts 13:4; 15:39; 21:3–16; 27:4).",
